{"id": "6th-t2-u1-078", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "6", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "u1", "lesson_id": "u1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-u1", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "சொல்லின் இறுதி எழுத்து விதிகளையும் விதிவிலக்குகளையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I:\n(a) எகர உயிர்மெய் வரிசை (கெ - னெ)\n(b) ஒகர உயிர்மெய் வரிசை\n(c) ஙகர உயிர்மெய் வரிசை\n(d) அளபெடை எழுத்துகள்\n\nபட்டியல் II:\n1. இறுதியில் உயிரெழுத்துகள் வர உதவும் அமைப்பு\n2. சொல்லின் இறுதியில் அறவே வராது\n3. 'நொ' தவிர பிற எழுத்துகள் இறுதியில் வாரா\n4. எந்த எழுத்தும் மொழி இறுதியில் வருவதில்லை", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1", "D": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2"}, "explanation": "எகர வரிசை - எதுவுமே வராது (4); ஒகர வரிசை - நொ தவிர பிற வாரா (3); ஙகர வரிசை - அறவே வராது (2); அளபெடை - இறுதியில் உயிர் வர உதவும் (1). சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": null, "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": null, "B": null, "C": null, "D": null}, "explanation": null}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "C", "accepted_keys": ["C"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "6", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "publication_year": "2025", "page": null, "chapter": "u1", "section": null, "reference": "Standard 6, Term 2, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name": null, "year": null, "paper": null, "session": null, "question_number": null, "official_question_paper_url": null, "official_answer_key_url": null}, "media": {"has_media": false, "items": []}, "tags": ["general_tamil", "std_6", "term_2", "match"], "language_status": {"ta": "available", "en": "not_available"}, "workflow": {"status": "published", "verification_status": "verified", "created_by": "TNPSC Engine", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "updated_by": null, "updated_at": null, "verified_by": "Antigravity AI", "verified_at": "2026-11-02T00:00:00Z", "archived_at": null}, "version": {"current": 1, "previous_version_id": null, "revision_reason": null}}
{"id": "6th-t2-u1-075", "schema_version": "1.0", "kind": "match", "level": "SSLC", "difficulty": "medium", "exam_mappings": ["group_4", "group_2", "group_2a"], "syllabus": {"class": "6", "subject_id": "general_tamil", "term": "2", "unit_id": "u1", "lesson_id": "u1", "chapter_id": null, "topic_id": "topic-u1", "subtopic_id": null}, "texts": {"ta": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": "பிறமொழிச் சொற்களையும் அவற்றின் இறுதி மெய்களையும் பொருத்துக:\nபட்டியல் I (சொல்):\n(a) கார்த்திக்\n(b) ஹாங்காங்\n(c) சுஜித்\n(d) திலீப்\n\nபட்டியல் II (இறுதி மெய்):\n1. ப்\n2. த்\n3. ங்\n4. க்", "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": "(a)-1, (b)-2, (c)-3, (d)-4", "B": "(a)-2, (b)-3, (c)-4, (d)-1", "C": "(a)-3, (b)-4, (c)-1, (d)-2", "D": "(a)-4, (b)-3, (c)-2, (d)-1"}, "explanation": "கார்த்திக் - க்; ஹாங்காங் - ங்; சுஜித் - த்; திலீப் - ப். சரியான வரிசை: 4, 3, 2, 1."}, "en": {"blocks": [{"type": "text", "content": null, "media_id": null}], "options": {"A": null, "B": null, "C": null, "D": null}, "explanation": null}}, "question_data": {"assertion": null, "reason": null, "statements": [], "matching_pairs": {"left": [], "right": []}, "ordered_items": [], "numeric_answer": null, "passage_reference": null, "table_reference": null, "image_reference": null}, "answer": {"correct_key": "D", "accepted_keys": ["D"], "correct_order": [], "matching_answer": [], "numeric_value": null, "answer_notes": null}, "question_settings": {"is_negative_question": false, "marks": 1.5, "negative_marks": 0.0, "allow_multiple_answers": false, "shuffle_options": true, "is_active_eligible": true}, "source": {"type": "book", "book_name": "Tamil Nadu Samacheer Kalvi", "publisher": "Tamil Nadu Textbook and Educational Services Corporation", "class": "6", "term": "2", "edition": "2024-2025", "publication_year": "2025", "page": null, "chapter": "u1", "section": null, "reference": "Standard 6, Term 2, Unit 1, Page 16", "url": null, "source_notes": null}, "previous_year": {"is_previous_year": false, "exam": null, "exam_name"